{"script":"s_3_10_0","des":"埃迪蒂！我的偶像！ 接取步骤","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"埃尔戈瓦","text":"[show]你最近也太过于怠慢了，奥希娅尔！我们是维护大市集秩序的治安队，一旦我们掉了链子，大市集多少人得受到牵连！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奥希娅尔","text":"[show]对、对不起，埃尔戈瓦队长……我、我最近只是有些心事而已，干扰到工作了……真的很抱歉……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"埃尔戈瓦","text":"[show]唉……你这孩子平时也不是这样的，你是碰到了什么纠结的事情了吗？魂好像都丢没了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"埃尔戈瓦","text":"[show]算了，我也不过多指责你了。我不希望再见到你再犯错，赶快把你自己的事情解决掉。明白了吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奥希娅尔","text":"[show]是……是的！我明白了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"埃尔戈瓦","text":"[show]行，我先去那片区域巡逻了，你整理一下，也赶快跟上来吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奥希娅尔","text":"[show]……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奥希娅尔","text":"[show]怎么办……说是要解决这件事，但是最近的排班也太多了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奥希娅尔","text":"[show]再这样下去的话，别说追赶上埃迪蒂小姐……就连大市集的居民都会对我失望啊……[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"那个……","tag":"tag_12"},{"text":"你没事吧……","tag":"tag_12"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奥希娅尔","text":"[cm][show]呀！你们……你们不是之前跟着埃迪蒂小姐的契约者吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"s